<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-England A beat South Australia by 12 runs.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-England A beat South Australia by 12 runs.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>England A defeated South Australia by 12 runs in their four day match at the Adelaide Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Set 170 to win, South Australia crumbled on the final day to be all out for 157 after being 70 for five at lunch.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
